WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.587
If your country was under attack
by a giant radioactive monster, what would you do?

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:07.382
Tokyo is about to be destroyed,
and your government

00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:10.385
is responsible
for stopping the creature in its tracks.

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:12.053
I'm going to break down the mistakes

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:16.433
made, what you should do,
and how to beat Godzilla in Shin Godzilla.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:19.853
This country is about to face a crisis
like never before.

00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:23.189
The Coast Guard spot a stranded yacht
floating in Tokyo Bay.

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:28.027
Finding only some personal effects. They wonder
if someone fell off the yacht and drowned.

00:00:28.069 --> 00:00:30.822
Suddenly the sea erupts from below
and massive amounts

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:33.283
of blood bursts into this underwater highway.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:37.579
The government arranges a meeting to discuss
what just happened, and they see on the news

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:42.333
what looks to be a volcanic eruption at Tokyo Bay,
forcing people to evacuate.

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:44.669
The government
runs through a list of possibilities,

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:46.713
including the idea of a new volcano.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:50.842
But one official interrupts
to say that the bay is too shallow for a volcano.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:54.220
Yaguchi here tells the others
that their theories are all wrong.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.930
There's something in that bay.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:01:00.643
They move operations into a conference room as
more and more civilians keep evacuating the area.

00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:04.147
Suddenly, the government gets word
that eruption activity is dying down.

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:05.815
But Yaguchi here calls B.S.

00:01:05.815 --> 00:01:10.487
on that and says that a massive creature could be
behind all of this, but no one believes him.

00:01:10.528 --> 00:01:14.616
They watch another broadcast and see a giant tail
come out of the ocean.

00:01:14.657 --> 00:01:15.617
The government is split

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:20.038
between wanting to kill this creature
as soon as possible or capture it for research.

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:24.501
This lady analyzes the video and thinks
